# OAuth docs — the whole folder, not a list of filenames. It holds downloaded OAuth
# client configs (the Web client's carries a secret) and console screenshots, and this
# repository is public. Ignoring it by name means anything added later is ignored too.
OAauth-docs/
resend/sending-permission.png

